"x":12362,"y":139380},{"type":"browser","id":"real-monte-carlo-doesnt-size-the-change","name":"Real Monte Carlo doesn't size the change by how good a move is: the best move gets a fixed 85%, every other move 5%","url":"../../boards/real-monte-carlo-doesnt-size-the-change-by-how-g.html","width":1000,"height":594,"metadata":{"type":"decks.board","path":"boards/real-monte-carlo-doesnt-size-the-change-by-how-g.html"},"x":13642,"y":139380},{"type":"browser","id":"yes-the-policy-you-keep-is-100-the-best","name":"Yes: the policy you keep is 100% the best move, and ε only spreads 20% while learning, but the averages then measure the play with ε","url":"../../boards/yes-the-policy-you-keep-is-100-the-best-move-and.html","width":1000,"height":563,"metadata":{"type":"decks.board","path":"boards/yes-the-policy-you-keep-is-100-the-best-move-and.html"},"x":14802,"y":139380}],"variables":{"decks-ink":{"type":"color","value":[{"value":"#1f2328","theme":{"Mode":"Light"}},{"value":"#e6e6e6","theme":{"Mode":"Dark"}}]}},"themes":{"Mode":["Light","Dark"]}}
